    <string name="about_salati_message">
    Salati version %1$s

Salati is an offline prayer and habit tracker designed for deliberate daily recording, configurable reminders, calendar history, and personal insights.

Salati does not calculate prayer times. Prayer reminders use the fixed times configured by you.
</string>

    <string name="privacy_information_message">
    Salati does not require an account, cloud service, or location permission.

Prayer records, habit records, reminder settings, and appearance preferences are stored locally by the app.

Salati does not send your tracking data to a Salati server. Android device-backup behavior depends on your device and system backup settings.

Deleting the app may remove its locally stored data.
</string>

